Falsifies `elf::note::verification::a_passing_extent_is_inside_and_advances`.

The defect: the padded end is never compared with the segment's length, so a note whose descriptor
runs past its segment is blessed. This is the lenient reader the module documentation refuses.

Expected to fail: `e.next <= len`.

